# GitHub API Configuration
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values

# Your GitHub username (required)
GITHUB_USERNAME=chilloutkav

# GitHub Personal Access Token (optional but recommended)
# Provides higher API rate limits (5000 requests/hour vs 60)
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: public_repo (for public repositories)
GITHUB_TOKEN=your_github_token_here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file: cp .env.local.example .env.local
# 2. Replace 'your-username-here' with your actual GitHub username
# 3. (Optional) Create a GitHub token and replace 'your_github_token_here'
# 4. The .env.local file is already in .gitignore and won't be committed